3. Generated TextMate grammar (syntaxes/regelspraak.tmLanguage.json)
   This file is generated output: it is emitted from the RegelSpraak v2.3.0
   ANTLR lexer maintained in the regelspraak-lsp repository, by that
   repository's `npm run build:grammar` tooling, and must not be edited by
   hand. The lexer it derives from is that project's own work, authored
   independently from the Belastingdienst specification (see the clean-room
   record in regelspraak-lsp). Earlier revisions of this file were generated
   from a lexer derived from a third-party grammar; as of the v2.3.0 rewrite
   no third-party grammar material remains.
